  "body": "Situated in sought-after Mellons Bay, you'll find a super desirable option for families looking for the complete package. This renovated brick and tile home boasting top-notch educational resources, stunning views, a family-friendly garden and a  beautiful environment for walks.\r\n\r\nStep inside and you’ll immediately appreciate the thoughtful, practical layout. On left, a formal lounge offers a cosy space to relax or entertain guests, newly renovated kitchen paired with a bright dining area opens to a sunlit deck, creating an ideal spot for family gatherings. Whether from the living room, dining area, or deck, you can enjoy stunning sea views, the Sky Tower, and Rangitoto Island.\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n• Zoned Macleans Primary School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College;\r\n• Walking distance to top schools and close to beaches, shops, and parks.\r\n• Easy distance to Howick Village's shops, cafes, restaurants and weekly Saturday farmers market.\r\n• Enjoy a quiet, friendly, upscale community.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• Sits on a generous half of a 1130sqm (more or less) section;\r\n• 3 well-proportioned bedrooms and 2 bathrooms;\r\n• Sea views louge and dining room seamlessly connects with the outdoor recreation area;\r\n• Easy-to-maintain garden with a private deck makes it an ideal spot for outdoor dining and play;\r\n• Single Internal-access garage with extra parking space;\r\n\r\nWhether you're seeking comfort, views, or location, this standout property delivers on every front. Contact Team Sandy today to schedule your private viewing or attend our next open home.",
